{
  "name": "gateway-hardening",
  "version": "0.0.1",
  "description": "Sample: wires ONLY the @open-rlb/nestjs-amqp multi-instance hardening features — cross-instance ACL cache invalidation, an optional scheduler lock for the rollup/retention jobs, a global HTTP body-size limit and an in-flight concurrency cap. In-memory stores, so only RabbitMQ is required.",
